[statement]
A name some package carries is decided as a real name even where the
constraint excludes that package: `b` needs `x>=5`, which only `p3` meets,
and `p3` is installed before `v` is decided, so `v` needs nothing more.

[repository]
P:b
V:1
D:v x>=5

P:p1
V:1
p:v
k:100

P:x
V:1

P:p3
V:1
p:x=5 v


[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p3 1
install b 1
